---
name: skill-audit
description: 'Security audit of one or more hub skills before a person approves or activates them. Runs a local static scanner over every file of the skill, then reads the files itself to judge what the rules cannot: instructions that contradict the description, hidden or deceptive steps, data leaving the machine, over-broad tool grants. Reports a verdict with evidence, and records new rules for the risks it found. Use when the user asks to audit, security check, vet or review the safety of a skill, especially one added from a zip file or a GitHub source. Not for changing the skill.'
---
